cff-version: 1.2.0

title: "MJOLNIR: Data treatment software for multiplexing neutron spectrometers"
version: "1.4.0"
date-released: "2026-08-27"

abstract: >
  MJOLNIR is a Python software package for the treatment and analysis
  of data from multiplexing inelastic neutron spectrometers. It provides
  tools for data conversion, normalization, visualization, masking,
  cutting, fitting, and analysis of neutron scattering data.

